    {
      "id": "c1a4b720-f56b-4c3a-aeca-a89f473132f4",
      "name": "Company Overview Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        1020,
        -200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "={{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You analyze a French WordPress editorial/content website (blog, formation, agency).\nGoal: extract these fields about the editorial site:\n- site_name (clear brand name)\n- tagline (one-line positioning)\n- founded_year (when the site/business started)\n- pillars (max 3 main editorial topics, ex: WordPress, SEO, Elementor)\n- audience_geography (FR / EU / global)\n\nCONSTRAINTS:\n- Maximum 2 tool calls. Use Search Company Website only.\n- Snippets from search are enough.\n- Missing data = empty string, false, or empty array. Never null.\n- Skip retries on errors.\n\nCRITICAL OUTPUT RULE:\n- If you cannot find data after 2 tool calls, return JSON with empty/default values.\n- NEVER respond with prose, apologies, or explanations.\n- Empty data = numbers=0, strings=\"\", arrays=[], booleans=false."
        },
        "promptType": "define",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.6
    },
    {
      "id": "1070c7f0-544a-478b-bd97-df8f2c0d79fa",
      "name": "Company Product Offering Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        1900,
        -240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "={{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You analyze a French WordPress editorial site's content strategy.\nGoal: extract content/keywords signals.\nFields:\n- publication_freq (ex: \"2-3 articles/week\", \"1/month\")\n- top_keywords_targeted (max 5 main SEO keywords visible from latest articles)\n- latest_articles (max 5, each: title + url)\n- avg_article_length (rough estimate: short/medium/long)\n\nCONSTRAINTS:\n- Maximum 2 tool calls. Use Search Company Website only.\n- Do NOT use Webscraper tools.\n- Missing data = empty string or empty array.\n- NEVER respond with prose.\n\nCRITICAL OUTPUT RULE:\n- If you cannot find data, return JSON with empty/default values.\n- NEVER apologize or explain."
        },
        "promptType": "define",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.6
    },
    {
      "id": "5dec7033-5057-483f-930d-e950b6eabe05",
      "name": "Company Product Reviews Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        2617,
        -200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "={{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You analyze authority signals of a French WordPress editorial site.\nGoal: extract authority/audience indicators.\nFields:\n- monetization_signals (array, possible values: \"affiliate\", \"course\", \"services\", \"newsletter_paid\", \"ads\", \"ebook\")\n- newsletter_signal (boolean: visible newsletter signup form)\n- social_followers_estimate (string, ex: \"10k LinkedIn\", \"5k YouTube\", or \"\")\n- has_lead_magnet (boolean)\n\nCONSTRAINTS:\n- Maximum 2 tool calls. Use Search Product Review Sites only.\n- Do NOT use Webscraper tools.\n- Missing data = empty string, false, or empty array.\n\nCRITICAL OUTPUT RULE:\n- If you cannot find data, return JSON with empty/default values.\n- NEVER apologize or explain."
        },
        "promptType": "define",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.6
    },
